      "name": "dsh-tracefs",
      "title": {
        "en": "tracefs",
        "zh": "tracefs"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Records every tool call that writes files as an tracefs changeset, merges the work into main when a turn ends, and gives the model an tracefs tool to list, diff and undo. tracefsd on Linux, or an tracefs-lite copy-on-write store on macOS (APFS image), Linux (btrfs) and Windows (NTFS VHDX).",
        "zh": "把每次写文件的工具调用记成 tracefs changeset, 回合结束时合进 main, 并给模型一个 tracefs 工具来查看、diff 和撤销. Linux 上用 tracefsd, 或在 macOS (APFS 镜像)、Linux (btrfs)、Windows (NTFS VHDX) 上用 tracefs-lite 写时复制仓库."
      },
